            "modified": "2025-10-24T17:48:33.591Z",
            "name": "System Checks",
            "description": "The DarkMe loader performs an inverted sandbox check by verifying the presence of 329 common user applications (e.g., Slack, Zoom). If none are found, it assumes it is in a sandbox and terminates.",
            "external_references": [
                {
                    "source_name": "mitre-attack",
