            "name": "DarkMe",
            "description": "A Remote Access Trojan (RAT) distributed by the Water Hydra group. It is delivered via a multi-stage VB6 loader and uses process hollowing for evasion. Its capabilities include stealing cryptocurrency wallets, capturing screenshots, logging keystrokes, and providing remote access.",
            "malware_types": [
                "remote-access-trojan"
